        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/azqa/{size}/2015_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-30T01:15:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>All of them look pretty amazing. &nbsp;Though he's not actually part of WCos, since he's part of the preorder I hope he counts: I think that Guise has a slight edge on the rest, for me. &nbsp;I like the attitude shown in the cards previewed so far, and I'm really eager to see how the deck plays. &nbsp;For the WCos heroes/villains themselves, it's a toss-up between Progeny and Kaargra Warfang. &nbsp;I like the idea of the Arena, and I'm really curious about how Progeny works.</p>",
