        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/blossercubbles/{size}/1863_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-30T02:52:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the villains are my most anticipated part of this expansion, though the whole set is looking amazing! I just really want a set of villains that I think will see regular play, and from what little I know of these four, I think they will be the first since the base game! Everything else also sounds amazing, as Sky Scraper and Captain Cosmic both are gearing up to be top picks for me along with Visionary and Fanatic (and friends).</p>",
