        "created_at": "2014-12-30T15:23:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Come on in, pull up a chair, help yourself to a train pun.</p>\n<p>Capt Cosmic looks like a good 'un, seems to be more of a support character who can blow his stuff up when you're in a fix. Otherwise I'm quite keen to see how Guise and Wager master play. Oh, and all of it, really. This looks like it could well be the best expansion yet  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>",
